# Store every text file with LF line endings and check it out with LF on every platform.
# A CRLF blob slipped into main on 4 October 2026 after a scripted edit on Windows; this
# setting keeps the clean filter normalising regardless of each contributor's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats are never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
